# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — "自研构建体系"型上游在 OHOS 的 Conan 交叉适配模式 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-13
# Software: erlang 28.5.0.7（手写顶层 configure + 递归 make + otp_build 体系）
# Gate: conan create build()/package()
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E3450
title: 上游自带手写 configure + 递归 make（非单一 autotools/CMake 工程）时在 OHOS 的 Conan 适配模式与 2.29.1 API 三坑
trigger_tool: configure|make|otp_build|apply_conandata_patches|Environment
phase: configuration
error_signature: TypeError: apply_conandata_patches\(\) got an unexpected keyword argument 'base_path'|AssertionError: env argument to ConanFile.run\(\) should be a list|AttributeError: 'Environment' object has no attribute 'apply'|neither TARGET nor OVERRIDE_TARGET can be determined
severity:               2
category:               ohos, build-system, cross-compile, conan
match_keywords: 手写configure, otp_build, 递归make, AutotoolsToolchain, toolchain 不适用,
  apply_conandata_patches, base_path, Environment, EnvVars, self.run env, TARGET,
  OVERRIDE_TARGET, target.mk, staging prefix, make install, --jobserver-style=pipe
root_cause: 自研构建体系把"宿主环境"假设写死在脚本里（bash、GNU 工具链、/tmp、chmod、
  mkfifo），Conan 的通用工具链反而与这些假设打架；同时 Conan 2.29.1 的若干 API 与文档/新版本
  不一致，照旧经验写会连撞三处。
affected_scope: 所有自带非标准构建驱动的上游（OTP/ocaml/ghc 类自举、vendor 里带自家 configure 的包）
verification_cmd: conan create archives/e/erlang/28.5.0.7 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing  # rc=0；test_package 15/15
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: manual-configure-make-with-environment-context
rec_description: 绕开 AutotoolsToolchain，手写 configure/make/make install 三连 +
  Environment.vars(...).apply() 注入变量 + staging 前缀安装；patches 走
  apply_conandata_patches(self)（不带 base_path）；make 并行强制
  --jobserver-style=pipe；对上游二次 config.guess 探测显式传 TARGET。
rec_command: with self._configure_env().vars(self, scope="build").apply(): self.run("./configure --prefix=<stage> --build=aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos --host=aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos"); self.run("make -jN --jobserver-style=pipe"); self.run("make install")
source_pr: erlang 28.5.0.7 适配（路径C）
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E3450.md
